/* Keep here changes of the base map style file only. */
@import("../dark/colors.mapcss");

/* ~~~~ CONTENT OF COLORS-BLACK ~~~~~

An OLED panel draws no power for a black pixel, so this variant takes the dark palette and turns
every *area fill* fully off, keeping only the line work and labels lit: roads, the route, contour
lines, water outlines and text. It is an aggressive bound on what an OLED restyle can save rather
than a general-purpose theme -- water, forest and landuse become indistinguishable from bare land.

Only colours may differ between the variants of a style family: tools/kothic/src/drules.py rejects
variants whose rule structure diverges. That suits the goal, since turning a fill black is a colour
change, not a rule change.

1.BASEMAP
2.BOUNDARY
3.NATURAL
4.LANDUSE
5.ROADS (kept lit -- these are what you navigate by)
6.LABELS (kept lit)
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*/

/* 1.BASEMAP */

@background: #000000;

/* 3.NATURAL */
/* 3.1 Main natural */

@glacier: #000000;
@water: #000000;
@water_bad: #000000;
@wetland: #000000;
@beach: #000000;
@barerock: #000000;
@scree: #000000;
@desert: #000000;

/* 3.2 Vegetation */

@forest: #000000;
@green0: #000000;
@green1: #000000;
@green1b: #000000;
@green2: #000000;
@green3: #000000;
@green4: #000000;
@green5: #000000;
@green6: #000000;
@flowers: #000000;

/* 4.LANDUSE */
/* 4.1 Main landuse */

@pedestrian_area: #000000;
@pedestrian_area_light: #000000;
@platform: #000000;
@leisure: #000000;
@university: #000000;
@hospital: #000000;
@industrial: #000000;
@sport0: #000000;
@sport1: #000000;
@sport2: #000000;
@parking: #000000;
@military: #000000;
@prison: #000000;
@farmland: #000000;
@farmyard: #000000;

/* 4.2 Aerodrome */

@aerodrome0: #000000;
@aerodrome1: #000000;
@aerodrome2: #000000;
@aerodrome3: #000000;
@aerodrome4: #000000;
@aerodrome5: #000000;

/* 4.3 Barriers */

@hedge: #000000;

/* 4.4 Buildings */

@building0: #000000;
@building1: #000000;

/* 5.2 Bridges */

@bridge_background: #000000;

/* Deliberately left alone: road, railway, piste and contour line colours, building outlines, label
   text and label halos. They are thin or small, so they contribute little lit area, and blacking
   them out would remove information rather than save power. The dark theme's halos are already
   #111100 / #060600, which is within rounding distance of off. */
